  "about": {
    "description": "The Alabama Gulf Coast Zoo is a richly diverse and decidedly unique small-town community zoo located in Gulf Shores, Alabama. Every animal at the zoo has a story. The zoo features a wide variety of animals including giraffes, big cats, monkeys, baboons, bobcats, camels, reptiles, birds, and more. Guests can enjoy daily keeper chats, animal feedings, a walk-through aviary, a contact barn, and special add-on experiences like walking in the lemur enclosure and giraffe feeding tickets. The zoo also hosts special events such as the Art on the Wild Side: Wine & Whiskey Stroll.",
    "elevator_pitch": "A uniquely diverse Gulf Shores zoo where every animal has a story and guests can enjoy daily keeper chats, giraffe feedings, and immersive animal encounters.",
